OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Traitors star reviews
OL,4,Aseason before final
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith millions poised to watch the
OL,7,Fsecond Celebrity Traitors final tonight
OL,8,Fformer star Joe Scott looks back on how
OL,9,Fthe series has played out so far.
OL,11,FThe series three Faithful and
OL,12,FSouthampton teacher spoke to BBC Radio
OL,13,FSolent's Katie Martin about his
OL,14,Fhighlights and how it compared to last
OL,15,Fyear's season.
OL,17,FHe also shared his views on who the
OL,18,Fwinner could be, as well as little
OL,19,Fthings that could give away a
OL,20,Fcontestant's position.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
